Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: is not only about stopping

445
00:43:29,940 --> 00:43:31,940
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: supply. It is also about

446
00:43:31,940 --> 00:43:33,940
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: reducing demand,

447
00:43:33,940 --> 00:43:35,940
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: preventing abuse, providing

448
00:43:35,940 --> 00:43:37,940
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: treatment, and helping people

449
00:43:37,940 --> 00:43:39,940
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: recover. DDB

450
00:43:39,940 --> 00:43:41,940
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: is not primarily an arresting

451
00:43:41,940 --> 00:43:43,940
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: agency, and it does

452
00:43:43,940 --> 00:43:45,940
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: not operate the entire treatment

453
00:43:45,940 --> 00:43:47,940
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: and rehabilitation system.

454
00:43:47,940 --> 00:43:49,940
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Its role is to help government

455
00:43:49,940 --> 00:43:51,940
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: build and coordinate one

456
00:43:51,940 --> 00:43:53,940
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: national strategy,

457
00:43:53,940 --> 00:43:55,940
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: linking enforcement,

458
00:43:55,940 --> 00:43:57,940
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: prevention, treatment,

459
00:43:57,940 --> 00:43:59,940
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: rehabilitation,

460
00:43:59,940 --> 00:44:01,940
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: and reintegration.

461
00:44:03,940 --> 00:44:05,940
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: That may not always be the most

462
00:44:05,940 --> 00:44:07,940
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: visible part of the government's

463
00:44:07,940 --> 00:44:09,940
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: anti-drug effort, but

464
00:44:09,940 --> 00:44:11,940
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: it is essential.

465
00:44:11,940 --> 00:44:13,940
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Because if enforcement is

466
00:44:13,940 --> 00:44:15,940
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: working in one direction,

467
00:44:15,940 --> 00:44:17,940
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: treatment in another,

468
00:44:17,940 --> 00:44:19,940
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: and local programs somewhere else,

469
00:44:19,940 --> 00:44:21,940
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: then we do not yet have

470
00:44:21,940 --> 00:44:23,940
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: a national strategy.

471
00:44:23,940 --> 00:44:25,940
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: We simply have

472
00:44:25,940 --> 00:44:27,940
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: separate programs.

473
00:44:27,940 --> 00:44:29,940
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: DDB exists to help bring those

474
00:44:29,940 --> 00:44:31,940
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: parts together. The

475
00:44:31,940 --> 00:44:33,940
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: available data show progress,

476
00:44:33,940 --> 00:44:35,940
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: and they also show why sustained

477
00:44:35,940 --> 00:44:37,940
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: policy coordination still

478
00:44:37,940 --> 00:44:39,940
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: matters. The

479
00:44:39,940 --> 00:44:41,940
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: 2023 National Household

480
00:44:41,940 --> 00:44:43,940
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Survey reported

481
00:44:43,940 --> 00:44:45,940
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: that current drug use prevalence

482
00:44:45,940 --> 00:44:47,940
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: declined from

483
00:44:47,940 --> 00:44:49,940
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: 2.05% in

484
00:44:49,940 --> 00:44:51,940
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: 2019 to

485
00:44:51,940 --> 00:44:53,940
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: 1.71%

486
00:44:53,940 --> 00:44:55,940
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: in 2023.

487
00:44:55,940 --> 00:44:57,940
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: That represents approximately

488
00:44:57,940 --> 00:44:59,940
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: 1.4 million

489
00:44:59,940 --> 00:45:03,160
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: people in the country.

490
00:45:03,160 --> 00:45:11,120
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: That decline is encouraging. Pero hindi ibig sabihin na pwede na tayong maging kampante.

491
00:45:11,120 --> 00:45:14,540
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Mahigit isang milyong Pilipino pa rin yan.

492
00:45:14,540 --> 00:45:18,140
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: And not every person in that number needs the same intervention.

493
00:45:19,440 --> 00:45:21,520
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Some may require residential treatment.

494
00:45:22,760 --> 00:45:27,240
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Some may need outpatient services.

495
00:45:27,240 --> 00:45:31,860
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Others may be better served through community-based rehabilitation.

496
00:45:33,140 --> 00:45:38,360
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: May iba na ang kailangan ay continuing support para hindi bumalik sa dating sitwasyon.

497
00:45:39,320 --> 00:45:42,820
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: So the task is broader than simply counting facilities.

498
00:45:43,700 --> 00:45:51,420
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: The value of DDB's coordinating role is to help government understand what kind of help is needed,

499
00:45:51,880 --> 00:45:56,820
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: where it is needed, and how people can actually reach it.

500
00:45:57,240 --> 00:46:09,020
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: For Fiscal Year 2027, the Dangerous Drugs Board has a proposed total agency budget of P526.54 million.

501
00:46:09,940 --> 00:46:18,820
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: In Fiscal Year 2026, its total agency budget was P598.17 million.

502
00:46:20,060 --> 00:46:26,820
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: That is a reduction of P71.62 million, or approximately 12%.

503
00:46:27,240 --> 00:46:33,460
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Its new general appropriations amount to P418.14 million.

504
00:46:34,340 --> 00:46:38,780
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: So this is not an agency asking for a large expansion.

505
00:46:39,820 --> 00:46:45,740
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Sa totoo lang, mas maliit pa ang kabuang budget na hinihingi para sa susunod na taon.

506
00:46:45,940 --> 00:46:52,640
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: But DDB is still being asked to coordinate a broad national strategy.

507
00:46:53,480 --> 00:46:57,220
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: That is why the proposed amount is reasonable.

508
00:46:57,240 --> 00:47:09,740
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Within the Fiscal Year 2027 proposal, P169.18 million is allocated to the Drug Abuse Prevention and Control Program.

509
00:47:10,860 --> 00:47:20,060
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Of this amount, P111.69 million is for policy formulation, surveys, research, and studies.

510
00:47:21,060 --> 00:47:26,240
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Another P32.84 million is for advocacy and information programs.

511
00:47:27,240 --> 00:47:31,900
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: And P24.64 million is for capacity building.

512
00:47:33,100 --> 00:47:37,200
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: The size of the allocation for research and policy deserves context.

513
00:47:38,380 --> 00:47:45,660
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: This spending is justified when it gives government a clearer basis for where and how to intervene.

514
00:47:46,760 --> 00:47:48,080
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Simple lang ang punto.

515
00:47:48,080 --> 00:47:55,680
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Kung hindi natin alam kung nasaan ang problema, paano natin malalaman kung saan ilalagay ang pera.

516
00:47:55,680 --> 00:48:04,900
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Kung hindi natin alam kung aling programa ang gumagana, baka taon-taon lang tayong gumagastos dahil nakasanayan na.

517
00:48:05,960 --> 00:48:16,580
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: At kung hindi natin alam kung ano ang nangyayari pagkatapos ng treatment, paano natin malalaman kung talagang nagkaroon ng recovery.

518
00:48:17,500 --> 00:48:19,180
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: That is why data matters.

519
00:48:19,180 --> 00:48:28,660
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Because research has a value, or research has value when it guides actual decisions to guide us for future allocation of resources.

520
00:48:29,420 --> 00:48:32,520
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: It should help identify where more treatment is needed.

521
00:48:33,280 --> 00:48:36,880
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: It should show where community-based programs should be expanded.

522
00:48:37,660 --> 00:48:40,640
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: It should guide where prevention should be strengthened.

523
00:48:40,640 --> 00:48:49,160
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: And it should help Congress and the executive identify which interventions are producing the best results.

524
00:48:49,180 --> 00:48:56,080
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: That is where DDB adds value as a policy and coordinating institution.

525
00:48:57,080 --> 00:49:01,060
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: This becomes even more important when we talk about rehabilitation.

526
00:49:02,160 --> 00:49:09,440
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: The Department of Health is in the best position to tell Congress the actual treatment capacity of the country.

527
00:49:09,440 --> 00:49:18,940
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Available beds, occupancy, waiting lists, outpatient services, personnel, equipment,

528
00:49:19,180 --> 00:49:21,120
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: and facility requirements.

529
00:49:22,260 --> 00:49:29,240
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: DDB should help bring all of that information together under one national strategy.

530
00:49:30,080 --> 00:49:32,400
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Kasi maraming ahensya ang gumagalaw.

531
00:49:33,240 --> 00:49:35,080
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: PIDEA handles enforcement.

532
00:49:36,060 --> 00:49:40,020
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: DOH handles much of the health and treatment side.

533
00:49:41,080 --> 00:49:44,840
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: LGUs handle many community-based programs.

534
00:49:45,600 --> 00:49:48,760
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Other agencies help with social support.

535
00:49:48,760 --> 00:49:49,860
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: And reintegration.

536
00:49:50,900 --> 00:49:57,300
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Kaya mahalaga na may isang malinaw na direksyon at isang national strategy.

537
00:49:58,280 --> 00:50:00,360
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Maraming ahensya ang may programa.

538
00:50:01,180 --> 00:50:03,360
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Maraming ahensya rin ang may pondo.

539
00:50:04,380 --> 00:50:08,140
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Ang tungkulin ng DDB ay tulungang pagdugtungin ang mga ito.

540
00:50:08,780 --> 00:50:13,660
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Para sa dulo, malinaw kung paano nagkakaugnay-ugnay ang mga programa

541
00:50:13,660 --> 00:50:18,660
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: at kung paano nito matutulungan o natutulungan ang Pilipinong nangayon.

542
00:50:18,760 --> 00:50:21,240
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: At kung paano nito nangangailangan ng servisyo.

543
00:50:22,040 --> 00:50:26,320
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: That is the value of a strong coordinating institution.

544
00:50:27,120 --> 00:50:32,220
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: And one reason DDB's capacity deserves continued support.

545
00:50:33,020 --> 00:50:39,700
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: The NEP also recognizes that rehabilitation funding extends beyond DDB's regular appropriation

546
00:50:39,700 --> 00:50:47,760
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: with statutory funding sources involving PCSO and Pagco revenues for rehabilitation activities

547
00:50:47,760 --> 00:50:48,700
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: and government services.

548
00:50:48,760 --> 00:50:59,660
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: The purpose of these funding streams is to translate appropriations into services that people can actually reach.

549
00:51:00,660 --> 00:51:05,760
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Doon dapat makita ang halaga ng pondo kung maaabot ang servisyo.

550
00:51:06,620 --> 00:51:13,080
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Kung may nanay sa probinsya na gustong ipagamot ang anak niya, dapat may malinaw siyang mapupuntahan.

551
00:51:14,080 --> 00:51:18,620
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Kung natapos ang rehab, dapat may support sa pagbalik sa komunidad.

552
00:51:18,760 --> 00:51:26,200
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: At kung may community-based program, alam natin dapat kung alin ang talagang efektibo.

553
00:51:27,020 --> 00:51:31,620
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Those are the outcomes this budget should help government deliver.

554
00:51:32,440 --> 00:51:40,280
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Mr. Speaker, a credible anti-drug policy has to know the difference between those who profit from illegal drugs

555
00:51:40,280 --> 00:51:44,300
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: and those who are trying to free themselves from dependence.

556
00:51:44,300 --> 00:51:46,980
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: The distinction should remain.

557
00:51:47,620 --> 00:51:48,700
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Sa sindikato, matatagal.

558
00:51:48,760 --> 00:51:49,740
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Sa tagang batas.

559
00:51:50,300 --> 00:51:54,820
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Sa taong gustong magbago, may tulong at may daan pabalik.

560
00:51:55,680 --> 00:52:04,160
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: And between those two responsibilities, enforcement on one side, recovery on the other,

561
00:52:04,720 --> 00:52:07,340
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: we need policy that connects the work of government.

562
00:52:08,000 --> 00:52:09,760
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: That is where DDB matters.

563
00:52:10,800 --> 00:52:14,260
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: So the purpose of this budget is not simply to maintain an office.

564
00:52:14,940 --> 00:52:17,580
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: It is to maintain the institution that helps government.

565
00:52:17,580 --> 00:52:18,580
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: See them.

566
00:52:18,760 --> 00:52:21,580
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: To prevent our problem and respond to it as one.

567
00:52:21,580 --> 00:52:23,580
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: And one clear objective.

568
00:52:23,580 --> 00:52:31,680
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Fewer Filipino harmed by illegal drugs and more Filipinos given a real chance to recover.

569
00:52:31,680 --> 00:52:34,680
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Yan ang mahalagang trabaho ng DDB.

570
00:52:34,680 --> 00:52:46,140
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: And for these reasons, I rise to sponsor and respectfully urge this House to approve the proposed fiscal year 2027 budget of the Dangerous Drugs Board.

571
00:52:46,140 --> 00:52:48,140
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Maraming salamat, Mr. Speaker.

572
00:52:48,760 --> 00:52:50,260
Deputy Speaker Vincent Franco "Duke" D. Frasco: Thank you very much.

573
00:52:50,360 --> 00:52:51,020
Deputy Speaker Vincent Franco "Duke" D. Frasco: Majority Leader.

574
00:52:51,720 --> 00:53:00,040
Rep. Ernesto "Ernix" Dionisio Jr.: Mr. Speaker, I move to recognize Representative Presley C. De Jesus of Partylist, Filireka,

575
00:53:00,620 --> 00:53:05,660
Rep. Ernesto "Ernix" Dionisio Jr.: to interpolate the sponsor on the proposed budget of the Dangerous Drugs Board.

576
00:53:06,060 --> 00:53:09,700
Deputy Speaker Vincent Franco "Duke" D. Frasco: Representative Presley De Jesus is recognized to interpolate the sponsor.

577
00:53:10,700 --> 00:53:12,240
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Thank you, Mr. Speaker.

578
00:53:12,240 --> 00:53:17,240
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: May the good sponsor yield some questions from this representation.

579
00:53:18,760 --> 00:53:24,700
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: May first question, para alam po ng ating mga kababayan na nakikinig.

580
00:53:24,700 --> 00:53:31,080
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: What is the primary function of DDB or Dangerous Drugs Board?

581
00:53:32,760 --> 00:53:40,200
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Basically, DDB is a coordinating agency involved in policy formulation.

582
00:53:40,200 --> 00:53:48,120
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: In order for us to adopt a national strategy,

583
00:53:48,760 --> 00:53:54,120
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: to have the national strategy against illegal drugs.

584
00:53:54,120 --> 00:54:00,400
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Ito ang nagpapatupad ng Philippine Anti-Illegal Drugs Strategy natin.

585
00:54:02,220 --> 00:54:04,560
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Mr. Speaker, this is my sponsor.

586
00:54:04,760 --> 00:54:07,980
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Does it include our local government units?

587
00:54:08,760 --> 00:54:16,040
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Sa community-based rehabilitation program ay kasama ang mga local government unit natin.

588
00:54:16,800 --> 00:54:18,320
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: At tulad ng ating nabanggit,

589
00:54:18,760 --> 00:54:24,180
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: ang ibang revenue stream na nakukuha ng DDB,

590
00:54:25,040 --> 00:54:29,440
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: lalo na yung mga itinakda ng batas,

591
00:54:29,940 --> 00:54:37,600
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: ang mga ahensya upang magbigay ng tulong tulad ng PagCorp or PCSO.

592
00:54:38,000 --> 00:54:45,600
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Ito ang ginagamit ng mga pondo o pantulong para sa mga pagbuo o pagtatatag

593
00:54:46,560 --> 00:54:48,680
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: ng mga community-based rehabilitation.

594
00:54:48,760 --> 00:54:58,240
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Ito ang ginagamit ng mga rehab treatment na pinamahalaan ng ating mga local government unit.

595
00:54:59,160 --> 00:55:00,060
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Thank you, Mr. Speaker.

596
00:55:00,260 --> 00:55:01,100
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: This is my sponsor.

597
00:55:02,120 --> 00:55:10,080
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Pwede nyo ba sabihin sa amin ilan ho ba ang member ng board and what's the composition of those members of the DDB?

598
00:55:10,840 --> 00:55:12,240
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Sino mo bang bumubuo rito?

599
00:55:12,240 --> 00:55:12,340
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Thank you.

600
00:55:16,640 --> 00:55:18,600
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Mr. Speaker,

601
00:55:18,760 --> 00:55:22,760
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: we have 12 line departments.

602
00:55:22,760 --> 00:55:39,840
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Thank you, Mr. Speaker.

603
00:55:39,840 --> 00:55:49,300
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: We have line agencies, Mr. Speaker.

604
00:55:49,300 --> 00:55:52,680
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: We have 12 here identified.

605
00:55:53,140 --> 00:55:57,540
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Coming from first on the enforcement side,

606
00:55:58,380 --> 00:56:00,300
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: for example, the Philippine National Police,

607
00:56:02,060 --> 00:56:07,300
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: the PIDEA, NBI, DILG,

608
00:56:07,300 --> 00:56:11,940
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: for prosecution, we have the DOJ,

609
00:56:14,940 --> 00:56:18,020
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: for rehabilitation and reintegration,

610
00:56:18,160 --> 00:56:19,300
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: napakahalaga po nito.

611
00:56:20,080 --> 00:56:22,260
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Meron po tayong CHED kasama dito,

612
00:56:23,240 --> 00:56:24,760
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: DepEd kasama rin,

613
00:56:25,320 --> 00:56:32,240
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: ang DSWD para sa mga tulong na kailangan nilang matanggap,

614
00:56:32,860 --> 00:56:34,960
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: ang DOLI sa reintegration,

615
00:56:35,120 --> 00:56:37,280
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: lalo na yung katapos na ng mga,

616
00:56:37,300 --> 00:56:37,800
