Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Isa po yung sa Subico, yung 1,000.4 kilos.

751
01:05:25,240 --> 01:05:26,040
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: 1,000.4 kilos.

752
01:05:26,620 --> 01:05:27,280
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: O.

753
01:05:27,520 --> 01:05:28,220
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: 1,000.4 kilos.

754
01:05:28,240 --> 01:05:31,900
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Yung 1,000.4 kilos po ng shabu na nakuha natin.

755
