1498
01:51:10,360 --> 01:51:29,440
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Nakita natin yung listahan kanina nung natutulungan natin doon sa statutory contribution of Pagcor is merely 14 areas with a measly amount of 5 million per local government.

1499
01:51:29,560 --> 01:51:34,160
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Ang problema pa dyan, maitayo yung rehab center, paano yung personnel?

1500
01:51:34,840 --> 01:51:36,560
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Dahil hindi naman...

1501
01:51:36,560 --> 01:51:38,320
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Kailangan talaga.

1502
01:51:38,560 --> 01:51:40,100
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: May doktor ba doon?

1503
01:51:40,680 --> 01:51:42,220
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: May mga social worker ba?

1504
01:51:43,340 --> 01:51:46,660
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Napakalaki po ng mga pangangailangan talaga, Mr. Speaker.

1505
01:51:47,220 --> 01:51:48,700
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Mr. Speaker, good sponsor.

1506
01:51:49,480 --> 01:51:59,460
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Salamat po sa pag-agree, no, in principle, ng mga binahagi natin, supposedly, translations ng budget.

1507
01:51:59,460 --> 01:51:59,540
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Thank you.

1508
01:51:59,560 --> 01:52:07,720
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Sa sinasabing shift in the approach, alam natin na multidimensional yung issue ng droga.

1509
01:52:07,880 --> 01:52:15,380
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Sabi nga po, may issue on supply, on demand, ano na pong gagawin sa mga incarcerated, ano pong gagawin sa mga victim,

1510
01:52:15,520 --> 01:52:25,360
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: paano yung rehabilitation, paano nagagalang yung consent ng mga pasyente, paano na po yung mga pamilyang naapektuhan,

1511
01:52:25,360 --> 01:52:28,360
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: paano yung livelihoods upended dahil po sa...

1512
01:52:28,360 --> 01:52:39,040
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: either na-incarcerate sila dahil gumamit nga sila ng droga or even sila ay naging mga mules and distributors or even sila ay falsely accused

1513
01:52:39,040 --> 01:52:43,120
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: and ilang taon po silang nasa kulungan, marami po siyang dimensyon.

1514
01:52:43,580 --> 01:52:57,740
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: At kung nakikita ng Dangerous Drugs Board na kahit beyond their budget, no, may mga bilyones na nasa DILG or nasa DOJ na ang sentro po ng pagharap ng drug issue,

1515
01:52:57,740 --> 01:53:06,360
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: ay tuloy-tuloy na criminalization, prosecution, despite that there being data na bubaba nga po yung reported users,

1516
01:53:06,920 --> 01:53:16,600
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: hindi naman po ito nagtatranslate doon sa number of incarcerated, number of arrested, number of apprehended dahil po dito.

1517
01:53:16,940 --> 01:53:21,400
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: So kung may shift in framework, dapat po magkaroon nyo ng translation in budget.

1518
01:53:21,400 --> 01:53:27,420
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: At kung may kakayahan ng... at dapat po may kakayahan yung Dangerous Drugs Board na ipastol.

1519
01:53:27,740 --> 01:53:35,580
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Yung iba't-ibang ahensya na ilagay po yung pera na ito instead sa further criminalization sa pagrespeto ng karapatang pantao,

1520
01:53:35,880 --> 01:53:46,420
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: sa paggawa ng more drug facilities, no, and iba't-ibang mga pangailangan para harapin ito through a health-centric lens,

1521
01:53:46,720 --> 01:53:48,180
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: yun po sana yung gusto natin mangyari.

1522
01:53:48,180 --> 01:53:56,740
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: So ang last request na lang po, Madam, Mr. Speaker, good sponsor, ay once available yung e-pads,

1523
01:53:57,740 --> 01:54:04,680
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: ang po ang representasyon ng kopya na ito alongside nga po yung request natin na yung 2018 pads ay maisumiti rin

1524
01:54:04,680 --> 01:54:16,200
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: at yung report po ng konsultasyon ng mga organisasyon na nakausap, pati na rin po kung paano po ito makukonsulta pa sila

1525
01:54:16,200 --> 01:54:19,780
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: given na may target nga po na this year po siya lumabas.

1526
01:54:19,780 --> 01:54:27,720
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: We will ask the concerned agencies, Mr. Speaker, to comply immediately with the requested information.

1527
01:54:27,740 --> 01:54:42,700
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Mr. Speaker, hindi lang yung shift in terms of budget allocation, ang dapat makita yung shift in the policy correspondingly the budget allocation,

1528
01:54:42,960 --> 01:54:53,240
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: but also the result that we are expecting from the agency, and that is what we are also demanding from the agency.

1529
01:54:53,600 --> 01:54:57,720
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Gusto lang ipabahagi lang ito, Mr. Speaker.

1530
01:54:57,740 --> 01:55:11,900
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Mr. Speaker ng DDB, yung supply reduction natin, yung budget ay mas mababa with 42% po against dun sa demand reduction po.

1531
01:55:12,060 --> 01:55:17,940
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Ito yung isang sinasabi nila na against 57% dun sa budget.

1532
01:55:18,660 --> 01:55:26,740
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Ito yung sinasabi nila na nag-shift na tayo konti-konti dun sa budget natin.

1533
01:55:27,740 --> 01:55:33,380
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Correspondingly or relative to the shift in policy.

1534
01:55:34,420 --> 01:55:35,100
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Ito po yun.

1535
01:55:35,100 --> 01:55:44,020
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: At ito rin yung gusto rin ng DDB nga na may-access yung mga services galing sa iba pang mga agency.

1536
01:55:44,380 --> 01:55:57,420
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Sa DOH, sa DepEd, sa CHED, sa DSWD, dahil ang budget ay malaki naman talaga kung may ko-coordinate at may uugnay.

1537
01:55:57,740 --> 01:56:01,400
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Tulad ng aking pinaliwanag kanina sa aking sponsorship speech,

1538
01:56:02,020 --> 01:56:09,660
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: ang malaking gawain ng DDB ay makapag-ugnay ng mga pangangailangan nito sa iba't ibang ahensya.

1539
01:56:09,660 --> 01:56:19,900
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: And it can be done through the board having different representation coming from the various departments of the government.

1540
01:56:20,960 --> 01:56:22,260
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Salamat po, Mr. Speaker.

1541
01:56:22,460 --> 01:56:23,220
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Salamat po, Mr. Speaker.

1542
01:56:23,420 --> 01:56:24,040
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Salamat po.

1543
01:56:24,980 --> 01:56:26,420
Deputy Speaker Vincent Franco "Duke" D. Frasco: Thank you very much, Majority Leader.

1544
01:56:26,780 --> 01:56:27,420
Rep. Ernesto "Ernix" Dionisio Jr.: Mr. Speaker.

1545
01:56:27,740 --> 01:56:36,280
Rep. Ernesto "Ernix" Dionisio Jr.: Next, to interpolate the sponsor, I move that we recognize Representative Iris Marie de Mesa Montes of Partylist 4K.

1546
01:56:36,860 --> 01:56:39,720
Deputy Speaker Vincent Franco "Duke" D. Frasco: Representative Montes is recognized. Please proceed.

1547
01:56:40,060 --> 01:56:41,180
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: Thank you, Mr. Speaker.

1548
01:56:42,080 --> 01:56:45,280
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: Distinguished sponsor to the DDB, magandang umaga po.

1549
01:56:45,520 --> 01:56:46,420
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Magandang umaga po.

1550
01:56:46,420 --> 01:56:52,580
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: Ilang katanungan lamang po mula sa kababaihan, kabalikatan para sa kapakanan at kaundaran ng bayan o 4K.

1551
01:56:53,020 --> 01:56:54,300
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: Umpisahan ko muna po.

1552
01:56:54,640 --> 01:56:57,580
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: Maaari po bang malaman ang tunay na estrado?

1553
01:56:57,740 --> 01:57:00,560
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: Nang problema ng droga sa ating bansa.

1554
01:57:00,860 --> 01:57:03,640
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: Paano nyo po ito mailalarawan ngayon?

1555
01:57:05,340 --> 01:57:08,660
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: It's a work in progress po.

1556
01:57:09,080 --> 01:57:14,540
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Tulad po ng pinapaliwanag natin, ang pangunahin natin problema ay yung data po.

1557
01:57:14,880 --> 01:57:16,400
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Yung datos.

1558
01:57:17,140 --> 01:57:26,220
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Dahil nga po, 35 pa lamang LGU ang online na may access tayo doon sa impormasyon sa kanilang lugar.

1559
01:57:26,220 --> 01:57:27,220
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Paano yung...

1560
01:57:27,740 --> 01:57:37,680
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Wala pa rito yung hindi pa lahat ng syudad sa Metro Manila, alimbawa, ay naka-access tayo doon sa impormasyon na kailangan natin.

1561
01:57:38,160 --> 01:57:43,940
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Yung report po na nanggagaling doon sa mga barangay, sa mga badak na tinatawag po.

1562
01:57:45,520 --> 01:57:56,820
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Ang prevalence rate po natin buhad po noong 2019 hanggang 2023, batay po doon sa survey na ginawa.

1563
01:57:56,820 --> 01:57:57,320
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Doon sa National...

1564
01:57:57,740 --> 01:57:59,220
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: National Household Survey po.

1565
01:57:59,500 --> 01:58:02,060
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Pero ito'y datos po, numero po.

1566
01:58:02,680 --> 01:58:08,520
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Maaring may mga kulang o kaya may dagdag.

1567
01:58:09,120 --> 01:58:13,880
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Nakita natin yung pagbaba from 2.05%.

1568
01:58:13,880 --> 01:58:18,440
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Ibig sabihin, noong panahon na yun, ayon doon sa survey,

1569
01:58:18,440 --> 01:58:27,440
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: merong 1,675,000 gumagamit po ng pinapaliwanag.

1570
01:58:27,740 --> 01:58:28,840
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Nagbabawal na gamot.

1571
01:58:29,500 --> 01:58:34,200
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Eh, yung 2023 survey, naging 1.71%, po.

1572
01:58:34,320 --> 01:58:39,880
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Isang milyon at apat na daan at pitumpot siyam, ho, na katao.

1573
01:58:40,580 --> 01:58:42,380
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: May 16%, ho.

1574
01:58:42,540 --> 01:58:52,180
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: 16.6% ang drop na nangyari o pagbaba doon sa current drug use prevalence na tinatawag.

1575
01:58:53,900 --> 01:58:57,180
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: In a snapshot, parang ganito mo lang may papaliwanag.

1576
01:58:57,740 --> 01:59:02,820
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Pero iba, siyempre, pag pinakinggan natin yung mga kwento,

1577
01:59:03,180 --> 01:59:09,600
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: yung mga sinasabi ng mga kapitbahay natin, yung mga taga-barangay,

1578
01:59:10,220 --> 01:59:17,260
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: ito yung gusto natin i-capture o pulihin para makina natin ng totoo.

1579
01:59:17,640 --> 01:59:23,580
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: At mangyayari lang yun kung may mga tamang informasyon tayo magagaling at the barangay level.

1580
01:59:23,580 --> 01:59:26,580
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: And that's the reason why we have an...

1581
01:59:26,580 --> 01:59:29,400
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: We want an online monitoring.

1582
01:59:30,420 --> 01:59:38,260
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: So, ibig sabihin po, Mr. Speaker, sa kasalukuyan, napakahirap natin ma-determine or ma-measure exactly

1583
01:59:38,260 --> 01:59:45,480
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: kung bumababa ang antas ng prevalence ng droga despite reports that, say, madaming nasamsam,

1584
01:59:46,140 --> 01:59:52,620
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: may mga na-aresto, libo-libo, o madami nang nadeklarang drug pi-barangay.

1585
01:59:52,620 --> 01:59:55,620
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: So, in fact, are we saying now that...

1586
01:59:56,580 --> 02:00:01,320
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: Yung mga ganong klaseng pagtingin ay hindi talaga nakabatay sa datos

1587
02:00:01,320 --> 02:00:16,200
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: Dahil wala tayong effective measure o wala tayong sapat na basihan sa pagsabi o sa pag-claim na bumaba na nga ang incidence, mas konti ang gumagamit, bumaba ang supply, mga ganong bagay po.

1588
02:00:16,200 --> 02:00:39,420
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Yung validation is a continuing process po. Ang pinapahayag po natin ngayon, malinaw po, nakabatay dun sa survey na ginawa po, this is a national household survey in 2023, ay may 16.6% na pagbaba po.

1589
02:00:39,420 --> 02:00:42,480
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Ayun po yung sinasabi po natin.

1590
02:00:42,480 --> 02:01:02,120
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Tulad po ng pinaliwanag ko kanina, yung bilang ng pagbaba po, pwede po natin sabihin may konting improvement po sa isang bahagi po dahil bumaba po yung drug use prevalence.

1591
02:01:02,120 --> 02:01:12,120
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: But what we're pointing at, and more importantly, is that meron pa rin isang milyon at apat na daang drug.

1592
02:01:12,480 --> 02:01:14,780
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Drug user, tayo.

1593
02:01:15,360 --> 02:01:31,360
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: At hindi po tulad na sinabi ko kanina sa aking sponsorship speech, hindi po natin pinagwawalang bahala po yung 1.4 milyon na yun dahil isang milyon pa rin Pilipino yun, isang milyon pa rin pamilya ang apektado.

1594
02:01:31,360 --> 02:01:39,660
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: At ang problema po ng droga ay hindi problema ng individual, hindi problema ng buong pamilya.

1595
02:01:39,740 --> 02:01:41,760
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: At maaring hindi po lang isang pamilya lang.

1596
02:01:41,760 --> 02:01:47,400
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: So, baka ng buong komunidad na kung saan naroon po yung drug user.

1597
02:01:49,720 --> 02:01:59,700
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: We recognize the fact that treatment should be readily, immediately, humanely accessible to every Pilipino.

1598
02:02:00,840 --> 02:02:08,460
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: That's the problem. Ang tingin po namin ay yun po yung malaking problema ngayon. Access to treatment and rehabilitation.

1599
02:02:08,460 --> 02:02:10,460
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: And that's the reason why we are...

1600
02:02:11,760 --> 02:02:22,080
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Calling the attention or there should be priority in terms of the budget of the Department of Health.

1601
02:02:22,700 --> 02:02:25,960
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Kasi yung treatment po eh, yun po ang nagiging malaking problema.

1602
02:02:26,740 --> 02:02:33,820
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: At hindi pa po natin na ipa-factor in yung recurring, yung bumabalik po.

1603
02:02:35,320 --> 02:02:37,080
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Dahil sakit nga po ito eh.

1604
02:02:38,240 --> 02:02:40,840
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Yun din po yung data na hinahanap natin.

1605
02:02:41,760 --> 02:02:53,160
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: That's why almost 40% of the budget of DDB is allocated for the research and survey so that we could establish the proper data po.

1606
02:02:53,160 --> 02:02:57,420
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: Yes, exactly Mr. Chair, Distinguished Sponsor.

1607
02:02:57,940 --> 02:03:00,140
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: Yan po talaga ang gusto kong tumbukin.

1608
02:03:00,380 --> 02:03:06,680
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: Kasi paano kasi natin masusukat po ang pulisiya, ang effectiveness?

1609
02:03:07,440 --> 02:03:10,960
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: How do we measure the effectiveness of the policies of the DDB?

1610
02:03:10,960 --> 02:03:11,120
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Okay.

1611
02:03:11,760 --> 02:03:16,020
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: Wala nga po tayong quantifiable or tamang sukatan.

1612
02:03:16,340 --> 02:03:22,220
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: Kasi it will bring us to later on yung problema kung paano natin maipapababa.

1613
02:03:22,360 --> 02:03:29,580
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: How do we know exactly in real terms na napababa na natin ang prevalence kung hindi po natin nasusukat,

1614
02:03:29,700 --> 02:03:36,740
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: kung effective yung ating pulisiya after all pala po ang mga pulisiya natin at hindi angkop.

1615
02:03:36,740 --> 02:03:41,560
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: Kasi wala po tayong metrics o wala po tayong tamang pagtingin.

1616
02:03:41,760 --> 02:03:45,440
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: Sa tamang datos on the ground, Distinguished Sponsor.

1617
02:03:45,440 --> 02:03:49,580
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: I would agree Mr. Speaker very much with your observation.

1618
02:03:50,720 --> 02:03:57,380
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Dapat at mahalaga yung data.

1619
02:03:57,720 --> 02:04:09,880
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Kaya nga yung survey research study natin sa DDB, nag-allocate tayo ng 111.69 million.

1620
02:04:09,880 --> 02:04:11,220
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Kaya ayaw natin.

1621
02:04:11,220 --> 02:04:20,680
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Mag-allocate o mag-alagay ng pondo dahil nakasanayan na lamang o kaya may nag-propose from the board.

1622
02:04:20,840 --> 02:04:21,180
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Hindi, hindi.

1623
02:04:21,760 --> 02:04:27,460
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Ang tulad ng pinaliwanag natin kanina, ang pagbabudget o allocation of funds sa DDB,

1624
02:04:27,460 --> 02:04:40,780
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: ginagawa based on drug use prevalence kung ano yung saan lugar pinakamalala at anong klase.

1625
02:04:41,220 --> 02:04:43,260
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: And then, yung inyong sa muntsa po.

1626
02:04:43,440 --> 02:04:47,520
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Affectation po, yung affectation na sinasabi.

1627
02:04:47,640 --> 02:04:52,360
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Kung mapapansin niyo rin po, yung mga tulong po natin doon sa pagtatayo ng mga rehab center,

1628
02:04:53,400 --> 02:05:03,540
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: hindi po ito dahil kilala o malakas yung isang kinatawan o mayor ng lugar.

1629
02:05:03,760 --> 02:05:06,340
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Kaya magkakaroon sila ng rehab treatment.

1630
02:05:06,340 --> 02:05:09,680
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Halimbawa po, si Anglas Pinas.

1631
02:05:09,860 --> 02:05:10,340
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Wala pong…

1632
02:05:11,220 --> 02:05:16,700
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Pero ito po, alimbawa, las piñas, meron po.

1633
02:05:17,560 --> 02:05:21,880
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Pero hindi po dahil malakas ang kinatawan ng las piñas.

1634
02:05:22,560 --> 02:05:27,760
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Galing po ito sa DOH po, hindi po galing sa DDB.

1635
02:05:29,120 --> 02:05:35,780
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Pero based on the prioritization, yung affectation, kung saan kailangan,

1636
02:05:36,380 --> 02:05:39,720
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: pati doon nilalagay yung mga rehab center natin.

1637
02:05:39,720 --> 02:05:43,200
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Pero kulang na kulang po, imagine, isipin po natin,

1638
02:05:43,760 --> 02:05:52,180
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: 60 milyon ang nilalaan para sa mga rehab, para lang sa pagpapatayo ng mga istruktura.

1639
02:05:53,520 --> 02:06:02,600
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Para sa buong bansa, sa higit isang libong probinsya at mga munisipilidad at syudad,

1640
02:06:03,380 --> 02:06:04,660
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: kulang na kulang po talaga.

