1807
02:16:47,480 --> 02:16:51,940
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Baka po ang iniisip ng marami may grants o may aid na nakukuha.

1808
02:16:52,380 --> 02:16:54,480
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Ang sagot po ay wala po tayong nakukuha.

1809
02:16:55,600 --> 02:16:56,480
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Maring yung standard...

1810
02:16:56,720 --> 02:16:57,920
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Standard practices po.

1811
02:16:58,440 --> 02:17:02,540
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Yung ating intelligence information, sharing.

1812
02:17:03,120 --> 02:17:06,760
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Dahil tulad ng pinapaliwanag po natin,

1813
02:17:07,360 --> 02:17:12,640
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: ang problema po ng droga ay hindi lang yung distribution ho locally.

1814
02:17:13,280 --> 02:17:19,500
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Higit sa lahat, yung supply na nanggagaling outside of the country.

1815
02:17:19,500 --> 02:17:23,500
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Kaya kailangan talaga makita natin yung mga...

1816
02:17:26,720 --> 02:17:32,740
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Yung ano po, yung daanan kung saan pumapasok ang mga droga dito ho.

1817
02:17:33,120 --> 02:17:36,580
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Dahil napakalaki ho ng coastline natin, yung mga ports ho natin.

1818
02:17:36,920 --> 02:17:42,520
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: So we could only do enforcement with the proper intelligence or information

1819
02:17:42,520 --> 02:17:46,800
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: that other countries could share with us.

1820
02:17:46,800 --> 02:17:55,440
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Tulad lang ng mga nahuli na isang libong mahigit na kilo ng shabu sa Subico.

1821
02:17:55,440 --> 02:17:58,260
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: So, the source is international.

1822
02:17:59,280 --> 02:18:07,260
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Yung po, best practices, yes, meron din po na ginagawa.

1823
02:18:07,420 --> 02:18:15,200
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Yung collaboration po na ginagawa po natin, yun po yung mga nakakatulong po sa atin.

1824
02:18:16,460 --> 02:18:19,340
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Transnational yung problema ng drugs.

1825
02:18:19,340 --> 02:18:25,120
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Iba yung nagpipinance, may nagmamanufacture, may nagpipinance.

1826
02:18:25,440 --> 02:18:28,640
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: May nag-import, may magdi-distribute.

1827
02:18:29,280 --> 02:18:32,620
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Lahat yan dapat ma-address po natin.

1828
02:18:32,780 --> 02:18:40,900
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: It can be addressed, I think, not only dahil meron tayong local net enforcement agency,

1829
02:18:40,900 --> 02:18:46,720
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: but importantly, yung international cooperation that we're getting.

1830
02:18:47,960 --> 02:18:51,400
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: Maraming salamat po, Mr. Sponsor, sa inyong kasagutan.

1831
02:18:51,840 --> 02:18:54,900
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: Sa huli po, nais ko lang sigurong pahayag na ang kinatawa,

1832
02:18:55,440 --> 02:19:03,280
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: kinatawang ito ay kaisa po ng DDB sa paghangad ng isang bayan na free of drugs

1833
02:19:03,280 --> 02:19:08,640
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: para sa kinabukasan ng ating mga anak at sa kinabukasan ng pamilyang Pilipino.

1834
02:19:08,860 --> 02:19:10,840
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: Maraming salamat po, Mr. Speaker.

1835
02:19:10,880 --> 02:19:12,440
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Maraming salamat, Mr. Speaker.

1836
02:19:12,440 --> 02:19:19,920
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: At, Mr. Speakers, I would like to note that lahat po na nagtanong ay in support of the DDB funding.

1837
02:19:21,920 --> 02:19:22,860
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Salamat po.

1838
02:19:25,440 --> 02:19:28,020
Deputy Speaker Vincent Franco "Duke" D. Frasco: Thank you very much, Majority Leader.

1839
02:19:28,820 --> 02:19:38,520
Rep. Ernesto "Ernix" Dionisio Jr.: Mr. Speaker, I now move that we recognize Representative Presley C. De Jesus of Partylist Philreca.

1840
02:19:40,280 --> 02:19:42,300
Deputy Speaker Vincent Franco "Duke" D. Frasco: Representative Jesus is recognized.

1841
02:19:42,800 --> 02:19:44,360
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Thank you, Mr. Speaker.

1842
02:19:45,240 --> 02:19:49,940
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: There being no more members for the minority who wishes to interpolate,

1843
02:19:49,940 --> 02:19:55,280
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: I move to terminate the period of sponsorship and debate for the budget of the...

1844
02:19:55,440 --> 02:19:56,580
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: the dangerous drug boards.

1845
02:19:57,280 --> 02:19:58,820
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: I so move, Mr. Speaker.

1846
02:20:00,520 --> 02:20:02,340
Deputy Speaker Vincent Franco "Duke" D. Frasco: Thank you very much. What does the House say?

1847
02:20:03,180 --> 02:20:05,280
Rep. Ernesto "Ernix" Dionisio Jr.: Mr. Speaker, I'm part of the majority.

1848
02:20:05,740 --> 02:20:12,660
Rep. Ernesto "Ernix" Dionisio Jr.: We join the minority in the motion to terminate the interpolations of the proposed budget of the dangerous drugs board.

1849
02:20:12,660 --> 02:20:19,420
Deputy Speaker Vincent Franco "Duke" D. Frasco: There is a joint motion to terminate the interpolations in the proposed budget of the dangerous drugs board.

1850
02:20:19,660 --> 02:20:20,480
Deputy Speaker Vincent Franco "Duke" D. Frasco: Is there any objection?

1851
02:20:21,640 --> 02:20:22,620
Deputy Speaker Vincent Franco "Duke" D. Frasco: The Chair hears none.

1852
02:20:22,760 --> 02:20:24,660
Deputy Speaker Vincent Franco "Duke" D. Frasco: The interpolations on the proposed budget...

1853
02:20:25,440 --> 02:20:28,440
Deputy Speaker Vincent Franco "Duke" D. Frasco: of the dangerous drugs board is hereby terminated.

1854
02:20:28,780 --> 02:20:29,240
Deputy Speaker Vincent Franco "Duke" D. Frasco: Congratulations.

1855
02:20:30,600 --> 02:20:31,140
Deputy Speaker Vincent Franco "Duke" D. Frasco: Majority Leader.

1856
02:20:32,200 --> 02:20:36,780
Rep. Ernesto "Ernix" Dionisio Jr.: Mr. Speaker, the parliamentary status of House Bill No. 10858...

1857
02:20:36,780 --> 02:20:37,840
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Salamat po, ma'am.

1858
02:20:37,940 --> 02:20:38,260
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Thank you.

1859
02:20:38,340 --> 02:20:38,820
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Thank you.

1860
02:20:38,960 --> 02:20:39,300
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Thank you.

1861
02:20:40,300 --> 02:20:41,420
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Pasalamatan niyo si ma'am.

1862
02:20:43,600 --> 02:20:44,760
Rep. Ernesto "Ernix" Dionisio Jr.: Again, Mr. Speaker...

1863
02:20:44,760 --> 02:20:45,200
Deputy Speaker Vincent Franco "Duke" D. Frasco: Please proceed.

1864
02:20:45,200 --> 02:20:51,680
Rep. Ernesto "Ernix" Dionisio Jr.: The parliamentary status of House Bill No. 10858 is that it is in the period of sponsorship and debate.

1865
02:20:52,280 --> 02:20:55,200
Rep. Ernesto "Ernix" Dionisio Jr.: I now move to consider the proposed budget of the...

1866
02:20:55,440 --> 02:20:57,180
Rep. Ernesto "Ernix" Dionisio Jr.: Philippine Drug Enforcement Agency.

1867
02:20:57,780 --> 02:20:58,500
Deputy Speaker Vincent Franco "Duke" D. Frasco: Is there any objection?

1868
02:20:59,300 --> 02:20:59,980
Deputy Speaker Vincent Franco "Duke" D. Frasco: The Chair hears none.

1869
02:21:00,060 --> 02:21:00,820
Deputy Speaker Vincent Franco "Duke" D. Frasco: Motion is approved.

1870
02:21:01,680 --> 02:21:02,360
Deputy Speaker Vincent Franco "Duke" D. Frasco: Majority Leader.

1871
02:21:03,100 --> 02:21:10,260
Rep. Ernesto "Ernix" Dionisio Jr.: Mr. Speaker, may we acknowledge the presence of the heads and officials of the Philippine Drug Enforcement Agency.

1872
02:21:10,260 --> 02:21:11,260
Rep. Ernesto "Ernix" Dionisio Jr.: They are...

1873
02:21:11,260 --> 02:21:13,420
Rep. Ernesto "Ernix" Dionisio Jr.: Usec Isagani Neres,

1874
02:21:13,960 --> 02:21:16,060
Rep. Ernesto "Ernix" Dionisio Jr.: General Rolando Miranda,

1875
02:21:16,840 --> 02:21:18,680
Rep. Ernesto "Ernix" Dionisio Jr.: Director Ida Ferolino,

1876
02:21:19,400 --> 02:21:20,920
Rep. Ernesto "Ernix" Dionisio Jr.: Director Ronnie Cudia,

1877
02:21:21,620 --> 02:21:23,440
Rep. Ernesto "Ernix" Dionisio Jr.: Director Agnes Mandap,

1878
02:21:24,180 --> 02:21:25,260
Rep. Ernesto "Ernix" Dionisio Jr.: Director Angela Saldana,

1879
02:21:25,440 --> 02:21:28,980
Rep. Ernesto "Ernix" Dionisio Jr.: Director Emerson Margate,

1880
02:21:29,500 --> 02:21:31,520
Rep. Ernesto "Ernix" Dionisio Jr.: Director Resty Lamonera,

1881
02:21:32,240 --> 02:21:34,940
Rep. Ernesto "Ernix" Dionisio Jr.: Director Marla Bridget Galvin,

1882
02:21:35,420 --> 02:21:37,300
Rep. Ernesto "Ernix" Dionisio Jr.: and Director Francis Del Valle.

1883
02:21:37,300 --> 02:21:46,840
Deputy Speaker Vincent Franco "Duke" D. Frasco: We acknowledge the presence of the heads and officials from the Philippine Drug Enforcement Agency headed by Usec Isagani Neres.

1884
02:21:47,460 --> 02:21:49,240
Deputy Speaker Vincent Franco "Duke" D. Frasco: Welcome to the House of Representatives.

1885
02:21:49,960 --> 02:21:50,540
Deputy Speaker Vincent Franco "Duke" D. Frasco: Majority Leader.

1886
02:21:51,320 --> 02:21:54,300
Rep. Ernesto "Ernix" Dionisio Jr.: Mr. Speaker, I now move to recognize representatives...

1887
02:21:55,440 --> 02:21:57,760
Rep. Ernesto "Ernix" Dionisio Jr.: Marcellino Marci R. Teodoro

1888
02:21:57,760 --> 02:22:00,960
Rep. Ernesto "Ernix" Dionisio Jr.: of the 1st District of the City of Marikina,

1889
02:22:01,540 --> 02:22:04,480
Rep. Ernesto "Ernix" Dionisio Jr.: Vice Chairperson of the Committee on Appropriations,

1890
02:22:04,480 --> 02:22:10,400
Rep. Ernesto "Ernix" Dionisio Jr.: to answer questions on the proposed budget of the Philippine Drug Enforcement Agency.

1891
02:22:10,700 --> 02:22:13,340
Deputy Speaker Vincent Franco "Duke" D. Frasco: Representative Teodoro is recognized. Please proceed.

1892
02:22:13,880 --> 02:22:16,440
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Mr. Speaker, my distinguished colleagues,

1893
02:22:17,200 --> 02:22:20,900
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: when we talk about illegal drugs, we can easily get lost in numbers.

1894
02:22:21,760 --> 02:22:24,720
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Kilosis, operations conducted,

1895
02:22:24,720 --> 02:22:26,720
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: personalities arrested.

1896
02:22:27,360 --> 02:22:29,360
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: But for an ordinary Filipino,

1897
02:22:29,920 --> 02:22:31,920
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: the concern is much simpler.

1898
02:22:32,560 --> 02:22:34,560
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Ligtas ba ang anak ko?

1899
02:22:34,560 --> 02:22:36,560
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Ligtas ba ang komunidad namin?

1900
02:22:36,560 --> 02:22:38,560
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: May ginagawa ba ang gobyerno

1901
02:22:38,560 --> 02:22:41,280
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: bago pa umabot ang droga sa aming barangay?

1902
02:22:42,280 --> 02:22:45,280
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: That is the public purpose behind the budget

1903
02:22:45,720 --> 02:22:48,360
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: of the Philippine Drug Enforcement Agency.

1904
02:22:49,060 --> 02:22:52,320
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: And the problem PIDEA is dealing with today

1905
02:22:52,720 --> 02:22:54,720
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: is very different from what it was

1906
02:22:54,720 --> 02:22:56,720
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: many years ago.

1907
02:22:57,720 --> 02:23:02,720
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Illegal drugs are no longer moving only from one street to another.

1908
02:23:02,720 --> 02:23:06,720
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Drug syndicates now operate across borders.

1909
02:23:06,720 --> 02:23:12,720
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: They use commercial cargo planes, airports, international parcels,

1910
02:23:12,720 --> 02:23:16,720
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: ports, coastlines, and the open sea.

1911
02:23:16,720 --> 02:23:22,720
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Nagbabago sila ng modus, nagbabago sila ng paraan ng pagtatago.

1912
02:23:22,720 --> 02:23:24,560
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Kapag nasanay na ang gobyerno,

1913
02:23:24,560 --> 02:23:27,560
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: sa isang modus, lilipat sila sa iba.

1914
02:23:27,560 --> 02:23:31,560
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: So the government must be able to adapt just as quickly.

1915
02:23:32,560 --> 02:23:35,560
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: That is where PIDEA has a very specific role.

1916
02:23:36,560 --> 02:23:41,560
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: The law mandates PIDEA to conduct anti-drug operations and intelligence work.

1917
02:23:41,560 --> 02:23:46,560
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: It identifies high-value personalities and organizations.

1918
02:23:46,560 --> 02:23:51,560
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: It coordinates interdiction efforts with other agencies.

1919
02:23:51,560 --> 02:23:53,560
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Its job is to make it harder

1920
02:23:53,560 --> 02:24:00,560
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: for illegal drugs to enter, circulate, and reach our communities.

1921
02:24:00,560 --> 02:24:04,560
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: And we have seen how serious that task has become.

1922
02:24:04,560 --> 02:24:10,560
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: PIDEA itself has identified airports, seaports, coastlines,

1923
02:24:10,560 --> 02:24:17,560
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: and mail and parcel systems as major entry points for illegal drugs.

1924
02:24:17,560 --> 02:24:22,560
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: It also documented the June 2025 interdiction off Subic,

1925
02:24:22,560 --> 02:24:30,560
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: involving approximately 1,484.65 kilograms of Shabu.

1926
02:24:30,560 --> 02:24:36,560
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: This is no longer a street-level drug crime.

1927
02:24:36,560 --> 02:24:43,560
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Kapag ganito kalaki ang shipment, malinaw may organisasyon sa likod nito.

1928
02:24:43,560 --> 02:24:47,560
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: May pera, may logistics, may intelligence, may network.

1929
02:24:47,560 --> 02:24:50,560
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: For fiscal year 2027,

1930
02:24:50,560 --> 02:24:58,560
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: PIDEA is proposed to receive 4.41 billion in new general appropriations.

1931
02:24:58,560 --> 02:25:00,560
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: For fiscal year 2026,

1932
02:25:00,560 --> 02:25:06,560
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: the amount was 4.37 billion pesos,

1933
02:25:06,560 --> 02:25:12,560
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: or approximately 1.1% increase

1934
02:25:12,560 --> 02:25:18,560
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: in the amount of 47.77 million.

1935
02:25:18,560 --> 02:25:21,560
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: This is not an extravagant request.

1936
02:25:21,560 --> 02:25:24,560
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: It is a measured allocation for an agency

1937
02:25:24,560 --> 02:25:28,560
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: whose responsibilities are becoming more complex.

1938
02:25:28,560 --> 02:25:34,560
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: And the way the budget is structured also tells us something important.

1939
02:25:34,560 --> 02:25:37,560
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: The Dangerous Drug Supply Reduction and Suppression Program

1940
02:25:37,560 --> 02:25:42,560
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: is proposed at approximately 4.06 billion,

1941
02:25:42,560 --> 02:25:47,560
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: while anti-drug operations account for approximately 3.75 billion.

1942
02:25:47,560 --> 02:25:49,560
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: At the same time,

1943
02:25:49,560 --> 02:25:58,560
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: capital outlay declines from 783.87 million in fiscal year 2026

1944
02:25:58,560 --> 02:26:06,560
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: to 640.59 million in fiscal year 2027.

1945
02:26:06,560 --> 02:26:10,560
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: So this is not simply about buying more equipment.

1946
02:26:10,560 --> 02:26:15,560
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Mas malinaw ang direction, mas nakatutok sa operations.

1947
02:26:15,560 --> 02:26:18,560
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: And there are results that justify continued support.

1948
02:26:18,560 --> 02:26:25,560
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: In 2025, PIDEA reported that 84% of its PIDEA-initiated arrests

1949
02:26:25,560 --> 02:26:28,560
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: involved high-value targets,

1950
02:26:28,560 --> 02:26:31,560
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: compared with a target of 60%.

1951
02:26:31,560 --> 02:26:36,560
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: It conducted 696 high-impact operations

1952
02:26:36,560 --> 02:26:39,560
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: against a target of 500.

1953
02:26:39,560 --> 02:26:44,560
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: And 73.88% of drug-related information and reports

1954
02:26:44,560 --> 02:26:49,560
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: acted upon resulted in actual anti-drug operations.

1955
02:26:49,560 --> 02:26:54,560
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Those are encouraging figures.

1956
02:26:54,560 --> 02:27:03,560
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Those results show that PIDEA is increasingly directing its work

1957
02:27:03,560 --> 02:27:08,560
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: toward higher-value targets and intelligence-driven enforcement.

1958
02:27:08,560 --> 02:27:13,560
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Ang mahalga ngayon ay ituloy at palalimin ang nagawa na.

1959
02:27:14,560 --> 02:27:17,560
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: The next step is to build on those gains

1960
02:27:17,560 --> 02:27:21,560
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: by reaching deeper into the organizations that finance,

1961
02:27:21,560 --> 02:27:24,560
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: import, and distribute illegal drugs.

1962
02:27:24,560 --> 02:27:29,560
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: It means identifying trafficking routes earlier.

1963
02:27:29,560 --> 02:27:35,560
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: It means strengthening interdiction before shipment can reach our communities.

1964
02:27:35,560 --> 02:27:39,560
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Sa madaling salita, hindi lang paramihin ang huli,

1965
02:27:39,560 --> 02:27:43,560
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: ang mahalaga ay kung mas napapahina natin ang sindikato,

1966
02:27:43,560 --> 02:27:47,560
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: at mas napipigilan ang pagpasok ng droga.

1967
02:27:47,560 --> 02:27:51,560
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: That is how the agency's present gains can be translated

1968
02:27:51,560 --> 02:27:57,560
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: into a more sustained disruption of organized drug networks.

1969
02:27:57,560 --> 02:28:00,560
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: That is the result Congress should continue to support.

1970
02:28:00,560 --> 02:28:04,560
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: And one reason continued support matters

1971
02:28:04,560 --> 02:28:07,560
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: is that PIDEA becomes more effective

1972
02:28:07,560 --> 02:28:12,560
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: when its operations are integrated with other agencies responsible

1973
02:28:12,560 --> 02:28:16,560
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: for our borders and national security.

1974
02:28:16,560 --> 02:28:22,560
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Its work is strongest when that coordination is immediate and operational.

1975
02:28:22,560 --> 02:28:26,560
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: We are an archipelago. Napakahaba ng ating coastline.

1976
02:28:26,560 --> 02:28:30,560
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: Marami tayong ports of entry. Maraming lugar na kailangan bantayan.

1977
02:28:30,560 --> 02:28:34,560
Rep. Marcelino "Marcy" R. Teodoro: So PIDEA must work closely with the Bureau of Customs,

1978
