06:31:59,040 --> 06:32:07,920
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: do you and Sir agree na dito sa mga tao na nabanggit po natin, may underperformance ang disyud pagdating sa implementasyon ng 4PH?

5817
06:32:07,920 --> 06:32:11,860
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Madam Speaker, hindi po lahat kasi interest subsidy niyan.

5818
06:32:12,460 --> 06:32:17,880
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: In new modality, may mga programa na pabahay na hindi na kailangan ng interest subsidy.

5819
06:32:18,360 --> 06:32:21,540
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Kaya malaki po yung unobligated amount po.

5820
06:32:21,940 --> 06:32:28,420
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: That's more on, like CMP walang subsidy, so it's more on interest subsidy po yan.

5821
06:32:29,040 --> 06:32:38,280
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Pero hindi po nangangahulugan na mababa ang performance ng 4PH program, Madam Speaker.

5822
06:32:39,960 --> 06:32:47,520
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Sa tingin niyo po ba may bagal pagdating doon sa implementation? At kung meron mang bagal, saan po ba nagbumula ito?

5823
06:32:47,640 --> 06:32:52,160
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Madam Speaker, nung muna, syempre mabagal. Kasi we are talking about single modality.

5824
06:32:52,160 --> 06:32:58,260
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Ngayon sa pagkadami ng mga modes, it's easy to access the program.

5825
06:32:59,040 --> 06:33:00,140
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: It's a 4PH program.

5826
06:33:00,680 --> 06:33:03,240
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: So sa tingin ko po, hindi na po mabagal ngayon.

5827
06:33:03,240 --> 06:33:08,940
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Kasi sa 15 months, 135,000 units na po ng 4PH program.

5828
06:33:09,540 --> 06:33:12,480
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: So with different modalities, Madam Speaker.

5829
06:33:13,840 --> 06:33:18,300
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ngayon, Madam Speaker, maghingi tayo ng construction update, kada developer.

5830
06:33:19,080 --> 06:33:23,860
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Meron ba kayo ngayong assessment kung merong underperformers sa mga developer na ito?

5831
06:33:25,140 --> 06:33:27,900
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: O sa ngayon, lahat ay sumusunod sa timeline.

5832
06:33:29,040 --> 06:33:35,780
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Madam Speaker, when it comes to private developers naman, binibilisan naman nila.

5833
06:33:35,880 --> 06:33:41,340
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Because they really wanted to sell the takeout unit, hindi din sila mababayaran.

5834
06:33:41,780 --> 06:33:52,120
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Remember, hindi mag-release si pag-ibig pag hindi tapos ang unit or mismo na turnover sa owner.

5835
06:33:52,460 --> 06:33:56,140
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: So kung ganyang bagay po, talagang bibilisan nila.

5836
06:33:56,600 --> 06:33:59,020
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Ready for occupancy before pag-ibig.

5837
06:33:59,040 --> 06:34:08,380
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: May penalty po ba ang developers kung hindi man makasunod sa target, sa timeline, sa plano?

5838
06:34:08,820 --> 06:34:12,320
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: At kung meron, meron na ba tayong naparosahan pagdating dito?

5839
06:34:12,420 --> 06:34:16,420
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Madam Speaker, sinususpende po yung license to sell ng developer.

5840
06:34:18,780 --> 06:34:24,760
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Meron na po. Madam Speaker, this would issue a cease and desist po.

5841
06:34:26,480 --> 06:34:27,760
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ilan hong developers itong...

5842
06:34:29,040 --> 06:34:32,480
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Suspend o nag-issue po kayo ng CDO.

5843
06:34:32,620 --> 06:34:37,460
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Madam Speaker, may we just submit the list? Kasi madamit po ito.

5844
06:34:37,820 --> 06:34:38,060
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Yes.

5845
06:34:38,660 --> 06:34:40,880
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Mga 141 po, Madam Speaker.

5846
06:34:41,600 --> 06:34:44,440
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: 141. Napakalaki nun, Madam Speaker.

5847
06:34:44,680 --> 06:34:48,820
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Kaya nga sa atin, hindi lang ito sa bilis o bagal eh.

5848
06:34:49,000 --> 06:34:52,100
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Madam, it's CDO, Madam Speaker.

5849
06:34:52,260 --> 06:34:52,900
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Yes.

5850
06:34:53,880 --> 06:34:58,480
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Sa mga kaso po na ito, kaya nga habang meron din naman tayo,

5851
06:34:58,480 --> 06:35:03,140
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: na pagkilala sa maaaring dagdag na maiambag ng mga developers,

5852
06:35:03,360 --> 06:35:08,160
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: ang pangunahin talaga nating prioridad, mapalakas yung ating sariling housing production

5853
06:35:08,160 --> 06:35:12,220
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: para makatugon dun sa pangangailangan ng ating mga kababayan.

5854
06:35:12,580 --> 06:35:15,380
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ngayon naman po, sa datos na galing mismo sa DSUD,

5855
06:35:15,700 --> 06:35:21,740
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: may total na 12.9 billion pesos na available na escrow fund as of February 2026.

5856
06:35:22,100 --> 06:35:27,160
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Pwede bang maipaliwanag ng DSUD kung bakit walang naging proyekto noong 2025

5857
06:35:27,160 --> 06:35:32,880
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: at wala pang balak na proyekto para sa 2026?

5858
06:35:33,700 --> 06:35:41,400
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Madam Speaker, sa totoo lang po, since 2025, meron na pong mga proyekto using escrow funds.

5859
06:35:42,920 --> 06:35:48,240
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: But yung disbursement po, progressive based on the construction.

5860
06:35:48,840 --> 06:35:53,700
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: And of the progress or completion of a certain project, Madam Speaker.

5861
06:35:54,880 --> 06:35:57,040
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Madam Speaker, maaari bang magbigay ang disbursement?

5862
06:35:57,160 --> 06:36:02,360
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ang DSUD ng detalyadong report ukol sa mga projects na napondohan ng escrow fund?

5863
06:36:02,480 --> 06:36:04,380
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Yes, Madam Speaker, we will submit po.

5864
06:36:04,840 --> 06:36:11,920
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ito po bang 12.9 billion? Meron na kayong plano? 100% para sa paggamit nito?

5865
06:36:12,280 --> 06:36:15,680
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Yes, Madam Speaker, 80% already allocated.

5866
06:36:16,420 --> 06:36:16,940
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: 80%?

5867
06:36:17,020 --> 06:36:17,940
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Yes, Madam Speaker.

5868
06:36:18,140 --> 06:36:20,340
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Para saan naman po ang 20% na natin?

5869
06:36:20,340 --> 06:36:25,280
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Depende po yun sa area, especially yung mga priority po ng gobyerno.

5870
06:36:25,800 --> 06:36:26,340
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Yun nga po, yung mga...

5871
06:36:27,160 --> 06:36:30,580
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Nasa danger zone, nag-aantay tayo ng lupa.

5872
06:36:31,220 --> 06:36:32,320
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: So yun po, Madam Speaker.

5873
06:36:34,660 --> 06:36:40,180
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ngayon naman, Madam Speaker, at abangan po natin ang ulat mula sa ating distinguished sponsor at mula sa DSUD.

5874
06:36:40,180 --> 06:36:55,900
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Sa budget presentation, makikita na sa direct housing provision, nasa 382,000 units ang accomplishment noong Aquino administration, 281,905 noong last administration.

5875
06:36:55,900 --> 06:37:01,320
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ngunit 81,295 pa lamang sa ilalim ng Marcos administration.

5876
06:37:01,720 --> 06:37:11,840
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ibig sabihin, kung direct housing provision ang pag-uusapan, makikita natin ang malalaking pagbaba ng aktual na housing production ng pamahalaan sa kasalukuyan.

5877
06:37:12,380 --> 06:37:14,780
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ano ba ang overall assessment dito ng DSUD?

5878
06:37:14,780 --> 06:37:25,080
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Hindi ba nagkakaroon tayo ng cycle kung saan binabawasan ang kapasidad ng public housing agencies, bumababa ang direct housing production,

5879
06:37:25,300 --> 06:37:25,780
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: at pagkatapos...

5880
06:37:25,900 --> 06:37:32,660
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Mas napipilitan ang gobyerno na umasa sa private developers at market-based financing?

5881
06:37:33,480 --> 06:37:38,060
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Madam Speaker, noong panahon po ni President Pinoy, 382.

5882
06:37:38,400 --> 06:37:44,900
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Tama po, 81,721 noong kasama sa panahon ni PBBM.

5883
06:37:45,720 --> 06:37:48,000
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Pero wala pa po yun yung 4-page program.

5884
06:37:48,220 --> 06:37:52,400
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: And if I can remember it right, yung pondo ng 2010,

5885
06:37:52,960 --> 06:37:54,640
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: nasa 15 to...

5886
06:37:54,640 --> 06:37:55,640
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: 10 to...

5887
06:37:55,900 --> 06:37:59,100
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: 15 billion po ang pondo per year ng DSUD.

5888
06:37:59,640 --> 06:38:00,480
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Bumaba ng...

5889
06:38:00,480 --> 06:38:03,060
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: I mean, bumaba lang po ngayon.

5890
06:38:03,060 --> 06:38:17,660
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: So, but kung titignan niyo po sa accomplishments, more than 301,000 sa panahon ni PBBM for PBH and 99,489 po sa direct housing provisions.

5891
06:38:18,280 --> 06:38:23,560
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: So, sa tingin ko po, tama naman, hindi naman pwedeng iasa lang natin yung pabahay sa gobyerno.

5892
06:38:23,900 --> 06:38:25,540
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: We need also to capacitate.

5893
06:38:25,540 --> 06:38:31,000
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: We need also to help.

5894
06:38:31,280 --> 06:38:35,980
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Kung mga sila mismo yung mga taon, hindi pwedeng puro dolo out tayo.

5895
06:38:36,340 --> 06:38:39,320
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Kaya nagkaroon ng different modalities tayo, Madam Speaker.

5896
06:38:39,860 --> 06:38:48,860
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: So, ang concentration ngayon, pag-ibig funds take out, para po, developers, both private and public, Madam Speaker.

5897
06:38:48,860 --> 06:38:54,860
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Again, ulitin ko po, yung pondo dati, nasa 10 billion, meron noong 2020.

5898
06:38:55,540 --> 06:38:58,100
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: 2015, umabot ng 15 billion.

5899
06:38:58,760 --> 06:39:03,400
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: And in 2022, dun po tayo nag-12, 10, bumaba talaga.

5900
06:39:03,620 --> 06:39:11,780
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: But despite and in spite na bumaba ang pondo under this administration, mas marami naman po ang nabigyan ng pabahay.

5901
06:39:12,140 --> 06:39:20,940
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Especially by 2028, it is expected na we will deliver 1,100,000 po indirect and indirect, Madam Speaker.

5902
06:39:21,420 --> 06:39:23,940
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ngayon, Madam Speaker, tungkol dun sa...

5903
06:39:25,540 --> 06:39:32,360
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Pagbaba ng direct housing production at yung pagbawas mismo ng capacity ng public housing agencies.

5904
06:39:32,880 --> 06:39:37,760
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Maganda po pag-usapan natin yung tungkol sa pondo ng National Housing Authority.

5905
06:39:37,760 --> 06:39:45,000
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Yung original budget proposal ng NHA para sa 2027, nasa 44.7 billion pesos.

5906
06:39:45,580 --> 06:39:53,260
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ngunit ang nasa General Appropriations Bill ngayon, kumigit-kumulang 2.27 billion na lamang.

5907
06:39:53,880 --> 06:39:54,760
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Napakalaki ng discrepancy.

5908
06:39:55,540 --> 06:40:03,580
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ano ba yung mga programa at housing projects na hindi matutustusan dahil sa pagkalaki-laki na reduction na ito?

5909
06:40:04,220 --> 06:40:05,740
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ito yung sinasabi ko, Madam Speaker.

5910
06:40:06,840 --> 06:40:13,640
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Bakit natin pinapabayaan yung mga public housing agencies na ganito kaliit yung pondo,

5911
06:40:13,720 --> 06:40:24,260
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: habang labis-labis yung pag-asa natin sa pribadong sektor para sa housing projects, programs na lubos na kinakailangan ng ating mga kababayan?

5912
06:40:24,420 --> 06:40:25,260
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Madam Speaker.

5913
06:40:25,540 --> 06:40:34,060
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Madam Speaker, kaya po humihingi po ng dagdag si NHA, pati SHAPSI po, Madam Speaker, sa Kongres.

5914
06:40:34,860 --> 06:40:44,300
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ilang housing units ba, Madam Speaker, yung maapektuhan ng mga pondong hindi na isama sa ating 2027 GABA?

5915
06:40:45,380 --> 06:40:48,160
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Sa NHA, pati na rin sa SHAPSI.

5916
06:40:48,860 --> 06:40:52,340
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Madam Speaker, as of this moment po, wala lang bagong project.

5917
06:40:52,780 --> 06:40:55,340
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Matutuloy at matatapos lang po yung mga existing projects.

5918
06:40:55,540 --> 06:40:57,300
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Na ginagawa po ng NHA.

5919
06:41:00,920 --> 06:41:09,600
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ngayon, Madam Speaker, hingin po natin yung detalye ng kanilang original proposal pagdating dun sa mga maapektuhan na housing units.

5920
06:41:10,500 --> 06:41:12,780
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Madam Speaker, we will submit po, Madam Speaker.

5921
06:41:12,860 --> 06:41:13,060
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Yes.

5922
06:41:13,760 --> 06:41:23,940
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Mahalaga, Madam Speaker, nalinawin natin na ang budget ng National Housing Authority ay dapat sapat ang pondo para sa mga programa nito.

5923
06:41:23,940 --> 06:41:25,500
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Dahil ang NHA.

5924
06:41:25,500 --> 06:41:35,720
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ay mismo ang pangunahing government agency na may mandato sa socialized housing production na para sa low-income families kabilang ng resettlement.

5925
06:41:36,040 --> 06:41:43,840
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Sa budget hearing, lumitaw na ang budget proposal ng NHA para sa 2027 na sa 44.7 billion pesos.

5926
06:41:44,300 --> 06:41:49,040
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ngunit ang nakapaloob ngayon sa GABA ay humigit-kumulang 2.27 billion lamang.

5927
06:41:49,040 --> 06:41:55,040
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Kung kinikilala talaga ng ating pamahalaan na napakalaki pa rin ng ating housing backlog.

5928
06:41:55,500 --> 06:42:09,300
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ngunit ang pangunahing government housing agency natin tulad ng NHA at kabilang na rin na tumutulong para sa development ng housing para sa low-income at marginalized families, ang SHAFSI,

5929
06:42:10,160 --> 06:42:14,600
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: ay nakakatanggap lamang ng pagkaliit-liit na bahagi ng ating budget.

5930
06:42:14,900 --> 06:42:20,680
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Paano po natin maaasahan na maaabot ang housing commitments ng administrasyon?

5931
06:42:20,680 --> 06:42:23,660
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Kaya yan ang hamon sa kapulungan na ito.

5932
06:42:24,040 --> 06:42:25,380
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Paano natin pupunan?

5933
06:42:25,740 --> 06:42:30,960
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Yung kinakailangan na pagtaas ng pondo para sa pampubliko na pabahay.

5934
06:42:31,360 --> 06:42:36,560
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ngayon naman, Madam Speaker, nais ko pong magtanong tungkol sa Marawi Rehabilitation.

5935
06:42:37,080 --> 06:42:45,680
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Sa 2021 Accomplishment Report ng DSUD, sinabi na ang Task Force Bangon Marawi ay nasa homestretch.

5936
06:42:46,040 --> 06:42:50,680
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Homestretch na ng pagkumpleto ng massive rehabilitation works.

5937
06:42:51,640 --> 06:42:54,600
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ano ang kasalukuyang bilang ng mga pamilyang displaced?

5938
06:42:55,500 --> 06:42:58,980
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Di pa rin nakakabalik o nabibigyan ng permanenteng tahanan?

5939
06:42:59,220 --> 06:43:01,080
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Madam Speaker, Distinguished Sponsor.

5940
06:43:03,040 --> 06:43:08,640
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Madam Speaker, as for Marawi po na proyekto, nailipat na po sa Office of the President.

5941
06:43:08,820 --> 06:43:11,480
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: It's no longer under NHA, Madam Speaker.

5942
06:43:13,160 --> 06:43:19,580
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Madam Speaker, pero hindi ba nagkaroon mula po sa taong 2021 bago nagkaroon ng turnover,

5943
06:43:19,580 --> 06:43:24,320
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: bago nagkaroon ng paglilipat ng situation report?

5944
06:43:24,620 --> 06:43:25,480
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Kumusta naman?

5945
06:43:25,500 --> 06:43:30,220
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Madam Speaker, as for NHA's scope po, finished, submitted na po.

5946
06:43:30,340 --> 06:43:34,580
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: And we will submit po the list, Madam Speaker. Tapos na po for NHA.

5947
06:43:35,480 --> 06:43:39,280
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Madam Speaker, mula po sa isang interview sa Philstar,

5948
06:43:40,060 --> 06:43:48,640
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: sinabi po ng isang former mayor na tinatayang 10% ng dating 200,000 na populasyon ng Marawi

5949
06:43:48,640 --> 06:43:52,640
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: ang hindi pa rin nakakabalik o nakaka-resettle.

5950
06:43:52,900 --> 06:43:55,280
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Samantala, ayon sa monitoring ng Marawi,

5951
06:43:55,500 --> 06:44:06,520
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: advocacy, accompaniment, humigit-kumulang 17,000 families o 80,000 individual ang patuloy na naninirahan ngayon sa temporary shelters.

5952
06:44:07,080 --> 06:44:16,360
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Maaari bang maipaliwanag ng disyud ang malaking agwat sa pagitan ng deklarasyon ng pamahalaan at ng aktual na kalagayan ng mga displaced families?

5953
06:44:16,740 --> 06:44:22,100
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ang sinasabi natin dito, Madam Speaker, kailan po ba nagkaroon ng turnover?

5954
06:44:22,420 --> 06:44:25,100
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Madam Speaker, as for NHA po, almost 3,000.

5955
06:44:25,500 --> 06:44:30,640
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: 3,000 units lang. It was last year po yung task force ng Marawi na turnover.

5956
06:44:31,900 --> 06:44:39,380
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Last year lang. So ibig sabihin, mula 2021, nung sinabi ko po, yung accomplishment report hanggang last year,

5957
06:44:39,900 --> 06:44:46,120
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: nasa disyud pa po yung malaking usapin nitong displacement at kinakailangan na resettlement.

5958
06:44:47,020 --> 06:44:52,080
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Madam Speaker, as for NHA lang po yung 3,000. The rest po, it's not under NHA.

5959
06:44:53,620 --> 06:44:55,080
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Meron po tayong presidential office.

5960
06:44:55,500 --> 06:44:59,500
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Advisor for Marawi or Bangon Marawi, Madam Speaker.

5961
06:45:00,000 --> 06:45:04,280
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ano bang role dito Madam Speaker ng DSHUD at NH?

5962
06:45:04,360 --> 06:45:12,200
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Hindi ba dapat na bagamat meron tayong specific office at task force ngayon sa ilalim ng Office of the President

5963
06:45:12,200 --> 06:45:25,280
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Kayo po bilang ating key shelter agencies ay meron pa rin nararapat na gampanin sa pagtitiyak sa karapatan sa adequate housing ng ating mga kababayan

5964
06:45:25,280 --> 06:45:31,160
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Madam Speaker, na-dissolve na po yung task force ngayon

5965
06:45:31,160 --> 06:45:36,520
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Nasa Marawi, compensation board na po yung programa na yan

5966
06:45:36,520 --> 06:45:48,160
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ngayon Madam Speaker, niris ko po ang issue na ito dahil ayon po sa mga ulat, meron pa rin mga displaced families na nakatira sa mga temporary shelters

5967
