Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: The reason why I'm asking these questions.

6506
07:15:48,860 --> 07:15:52,100
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Because we have to face actual facts. We should not sugarcoat it.

6507
07:15:52,100 --> 07:15:57,640
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Kasi kung, if we do not recognize a problem, then we will not be able to come up with a solution.

6508
07:15:58,360 --> 07:16:06,140
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Masasayang ang pera na, masasayang yung pabahay, yung oras na ginugol para gawin yung pabahay na yan.

6509
07:16:06,660 --> 07:16:10,520
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Tapos hindi natin nababawasan yung mga taong nangangailangan ng tirahan.

6510
07:16:11,260 --> 07:16:17,520
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Diba? That's my point, Madam Chair, our good sponsor.

6511
07:16:17,520 --> 07:16:29,720
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Because if we do not provide a fallback to this, alam ko meron tayong mga guidelines na gustong gawin.

6512
07:16:29,820 --> 07:16:38,760
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: But as I mentioned, for practicality purposes, based on what is actually happening, if we just look at it really,

6513
07:16:39,680 --> 07:16:44,500
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: then makikita natin napakadaming pabahay na sasayang.

6514
07:16:44,500 --> 07:16:47,500
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: In fact, naalala ko, during the time of former president,

6515
07:16:47,520 --> 07:16:55,460
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: President Duterte, nakalimutan ko ano yung mga nag-occupy dun sa mga pabahay na hindi pa nabibigyan ng beneficiary.

6516
07:16:56,100 --> 07:16:57,560
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: That also became the problem.

6517
07:16:59,740 --> 07:17:04,320
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Sino ba yun? Yung group that occupied yung mga housing units?

6518
07:17:05,220 --> 07:17:07,440
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Maybe NHA would know, or they should.

6519
07:17:08,700 --> 07:17:10,000
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: That was an issue before.

6520
07:17:11,120 --> 07:17:12,520
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Kadamay, Madam Speaker.

6521
07:17:12,520 --> 07:17:16,200
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Kadamay, diba? Dahil anong sinabi nila, anong binigay nilang reason?

6522
07:17:16,200 --> 07:17:16,920
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Sabi nila.

6523
07:17:17,520 --> 07:17:21,860
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Kaya naman yung mga unit, ang tagal-tagal nang nakatiwangwang, ang tagal-tagal nang walang occupant,

6524
07:17:22,360 --> 07:17:29,360
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: eh, tutal, ayaw nyo naman ibigay sa beneficaryo, eh, o-occupy na namin.

6525
07:17:29,520 --> 07:17:35,800
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Kaya, that was a problem before, and that remained a problem up to now.

6526
07:17:36,920 --> 07:17:38,580
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: So, ano yung ginawa natin?

6527
07:17:39,900 --> 07:17:41,520
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: What steps have we taken?

6528
07:17:41,520 --> 07:17:46,520
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: So that, as we construct units, we are able to...

6529
07:17:47,520 --> 07:17:53,580
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: put a family in this unit, para-housing units, para naman nagagamit na nila.

6530
07:17:57,480 --> 07:17:59,200
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Madam Speaker, yun nga po.

6531
07:17:59,700 --> 07:18:09,720
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Sa ngayon, from 5,000 units, 2,000 na lang un-unoccupied, at saka sa in-city na lang, in-province na lang yung beneficiary po ng NHA.

6532
07:18:09,720 --> 07:18:16,720
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Now, the things that kailangan natin maayos.

6533
07:18:17,520 --> 07:18:24,180
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: As I mentioned, yung utilization, not only of the funds given to the SHUD,

6534
07:18:24,600 --> 07:18:28,940
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: but yung utilization ng actual housing units na readily available.

6535
07:18:29,740 --> 07:18:33,180
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Pangalawa, there is also a problem with collection efficiency.

6536
07:18:34,260 --> 07:18:38,400
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Target was 50% collection, but actual target was 27%.

6537
07:18:38,400 --> 07:18:41,280
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: This directly affects financial sustainability.

6538
07:18:42,280 --> 07:18:47,400
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: If NHA cannot collect efficiently revolving housing resources, will deteriorate.

6539
07:18:47,520 --> 07:18:49,520
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Mas konti ang makaka-avail.

6540
07:18:49,980 --> 07:18:54,460
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: What improvements have we taken to improve collection efficiency?

6541
07:18:56,900 --> 07:19:00,520
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Madam Speaker, kasi una, may mga moratorium pag may bagyo.

6542
07:19:00,980 --> 07:19:05,140
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Especially ngayon na may problema tayo sa pagtaas ng crudo.

6543
07:19:07,500 --> 07:19:09,520
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Kaya po yun yung problema, Madam Speaker.

6544
07:19:09,840 --> 07:19:11,340
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Madam Speaker, good sponsor.

6545
07:19:11,720 --> 07:19:13,780
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Yung collection efficiency, yung tinatanong ko.

6546
07:19:13,780 --> 07:19:17,280
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: What steps?

6547
07:19:17,520 --> 07:19:21,200
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: What steps has the agency taken to improve collection efficiency?

6548
07:19:26,900 --> 07:19:31,100
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Madam Speaker, meron na po ngayon silang online payment.

6549
07:19:32,420 --> 07:19:33,660
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: So, they improvised na po.

6550
07:19:33,780 --> 07:19:36,120
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Yung online, dati kasi you have to sisigilin mo.

6551
07:19:36,240 --> 07:19:37,900
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Ngayon may digitalization na sila.

6552
07:19:38,620 --> 07:19:39,440
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Madam Speaker.

6553
07:19:39,820 --> 07:19:42,340
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Madam Speaker, good sponsor.

6554
07:19:42,340 --> 07:19:42,440
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Madam Speaker.

6555
07:19:45,640 --> 07:19:47,340
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Well, it's a well...

6556
07:19:47,520 --> 07:19:51,440
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: It's a welcome innovation that we agree with online payments.

6557
07:19:51,600 --> 07:19:58,440
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: But as we all know, the problem is not kung magbabayad ka ng physically o magbabayad ka ng online.

6558
07:19:58,560 --> 07:20:01,800
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: The problem really, it's really a collection problem.

6559
07:20:02,020 --> 07:20:10,980
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Dahil meron talagang mga binipisaryo, ang kailangan mong pupuntahan para makulektahan mo ng pambayad eh.

6560
07:20:11,160 --> 07:20:13,580
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: They will not do it voluntarily.

6561
07:20:17,520 --> 07:20:21,740
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Diba, sa atin na lang eh, hindi na bahay ah, sa cellphone.

6562
07:20:22,340 --> 07:20:26,140
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Diba, dati pwede ka mag-accumulate ng utang sa cellphone bill mo.

6563
07:20:26,260 --> 07:20:31,940
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Kita mo ngayon, ang ginagawa ng mga provider.

6564
07:20:32,460 --> 07:20:35,300
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Puputulin yung linya mo para mapilitang kang magbayad.

6565
07:20:38,560 --> 07:20:41,060
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: So, NHA, ano bang kailangan nyo gawin?

6566
07:20:41,060 --> 07:20:46,900
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Kasi hindi daw kayo na baka nag-i-evi, kaya hindi nagbabayad din yung mga owners.

6567
07:20:47,520 --> 07:20:53,160
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: But, you know, kailangan siguro ano, i-improve na lang yung collections.

6568
07:20:53,560 --> 07:20:54,940
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Yeah, that's why, good sponsor.

6569
07:20:54,940 --> 07:20:59,700
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: And we'll need to make sure that intensify na lang ni NHA yung collections nila.

6570
07:20:59,880 --> 07:21:09,440
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Actually, yun yung point ko, good sponsor, is what steps has the agency taken to improve yung collection efficiency

6571
07:21:09,440 --> 07:21:15,260
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: given its past experience of poor collection efficiency.

6572
07:21:15,260 --> 07:21:17,500
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Dahil talagang mahirap maningil eh.

6573
07:21:17,520 --> 07:21:18,600
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Ano yung point ko?

6574
07:21:24,200 --> 07:21:24,880
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: No.

6575
07:21:34,420 --> 07:21:37,580
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Yung sagot.

6576
07:21:38,280 --> 07:21:41,800
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Madam Speaker, sa totoo lang, natatawa na lang kami.

6577
07:21:41,800 --> 07:21:45,060
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Hindi naman natin pwede kayo napalis yung mga tao na hindi nagbabayad.

6578
07:21:45,600 --> 07:21:47,020
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: But, we can assure you,

6579
07:21:47,520 --> 07:22:01,840
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Sa pag-ibig, pinabales. 97%. Dito sa NHC, hindi. But anyway, the department, the agency will try their best through third-party collection agent na lang po.

6580
07:22:01,840 --> 07:22:18,740
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: As I mentioned, good speaker, good sponsor. I know we all know for a fact that collecting, especially kung hihintayin natin yung voluntary payment, it will really truly become difficult.

6581
07:22:19,660 --> 07:22:31,820
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: But through the years, alam na natin that there's a collection problem. But we cannot leave it as is na hindi kami gagawa ng bagong proseso to improve yung collection.

6582
07:22:31,840 --> 07:22:56,180
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: As I mentioned, the department uses the money as part of yung revolving fund so that it could be reused for other beneficiaries. Pero kung hindi talaga, kung wala talaga tayong gagawin, then we will not be able to serve a broader number of people.

6583
07:23:01,840 --> 07:23:10,140
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Madam Speaker, I will move ahead.

6584
07:23:11,440 --> 07:23:25,520
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Madam Speaker, they will try their best na lang to improve the manner of collection through third-party. Meron naman sila third-party collectors. Problema, hindi talaga takot ang mga tao.

6585
07:23:25,520 --> 07:23:31,620
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: But again, we will call the attention of the NHA.

6586
07:23:31,840 --> 07:23:32,660
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Madam Speaker.

6587
07:23:34,020 --> 07:23:34,260
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Okay.

6588
07:23:37,420 --> 07:23:58,180
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Ang dami ng measure, Madam Speaker, may expanded convenient payment, may paymaya, may land bank, may link bank, engaged private collection service providers, take-out mechanism of receivables with pag-iwig, implement cancellation, reward of accounts, strength and on-site collection, timely billing, distribution of demand letters, strength and regular monitoring analysis.

6589
07:23:58,180 --> 07:24:00,520
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: There are the things na ginawa po ng NHA.

6590
07:24:00,520 --> 07:24:00,640
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Okay.

6591
07:24:01,840 --> 07:24:03,060
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: In spite, ganoon pa rin.

6592
07:24:03,520 --> 07:24:10,280
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: With the indulgence of our distinguished sponsor and our distinguished colleague, we have one more minute. So please wrap up.

6593
07:24:10,280 --> 07:24:28,020
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Well, with regards to housing construction, the target was 2,338. Actual accomplished was 949. That's roughly 40.6% of the target.

