Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Ano po experience ng Disud in terms of the MMDA efficiency and capability para po mapasunod yung mga 17 nakaharian dito sa Metro Manila?

7063
07:49:20,340 --> 07:49:25,340
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Ginagawa naman daw yung MMDA, Specialist on Flood Control ngayon.

7064
07:49:25,340 --> 07:49:26,140
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Gusto po malaman.

7065
07:49:26,180 --> 07:49:27,200
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Yung mga waterways.

7066
07:49:27,200 --> 07:49:41,740
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Para mabigyan natin. Policy problems instead, yung ginagawa. Yung ginagawa, madali yun eh. Pero yung ano ba yung experience na problema at ano ba yung mga policy solutions para ma-overcome yung problema?

7067
07:49:44,280 --> 07:49:47,320
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: So ginagawa naman po daw ng MMDA yung Madam Speaker.

7068
07:49:48,700 --> 07:49:52,740
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Hindi nga po nagagawa. Parami ng parami yung mga informal setters.

7069
07:49:52,740 --> 07:49:54,960
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: So we will call the attention of MMDA.

7070
07:49:55,300 --> 07:49:56,020
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Hindi.

7071
07:49:56,180 --> 07:50:07,260
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Of course, ang gusto po kong malaman, ano po yung mga policy proposals ng Disud?

7072
07:50:07,260 --> 07:50:10,540
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: The department will coordinate with MMDA, Madam Speaker.

7073
07:50:11,200 --> 07:50:22,900
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Ano po yung policy proposal ng Disud, being the National Government's Primary Agency for Urban Development?

7074
07:50:23,600 --> 07:50:26,160
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Ano po yung nakikita ninyo na pwede natin?

7075
07:50:26,180 --> 07:50:30,480
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Ano po yung naging solusyon para may saayos natin yung policy direction?

7076
07:50:30,480 --> 07:50:38,240
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Other than the guidelines na ilalabas po ng Madam Speaker ng Disud, they will coordinate with MMDA po, Madam Speaker.

7077
07:50:43,060 --> 07:50:53,340
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: I believe this single sponsor, what the Honorable Erice is asking is how can he be of help? What are your policy proposals so that these problems can be addressed?

7078
07:50:53,340 --> 07:50:55,340
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Madam Speaker, it's true with policies and guidelines.

7079
07:50:56,180 --> 07:51:10,900
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Ano nga po yun? Ano po yung specific policy ng Disud upang ma-improve natin ang housing development at urban development dito sa Metro Manila?

7080
07:51:10,900 --> 07:51:16,560
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Madam Speaker, meron pong time manual po sa urban development si Disud, Madam Speaker.

7081
07:51:17,940 --> 07:51:18,460
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Ano po yun?

7082
07:51:22,560 --> 07:51:26,160
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Ito po, guidelines on how, on new town.

7083
07:51:26,180 --> 07:51:38,960
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Ito po, guidelines and planned unit development, resilient urban design development guidelines, transit-oriented development, open space development guidelines, Madam Speaker.

7084
07:51:39,040 --> 07:51:49,880
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Ano po yung response ng MMDA at ng mga LGUs at ano po yung degree ng pagsunod at implementasyon itong mga guidelines nito?

7085
07:51:51,260 --> 07:51:54,880
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: This has been developed last year po. So, currently…

7086
07:51:54,880 --> 07:51:57,980
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: At least, meron po kayong ano. Ano ba ang gawapan?

7087
07:51:58,040 --> 07:52:05,300
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Para makatulong kami in terms of policy direction. Baka kung hindi sumusunod, di pasunod rin natin through legislation.

7088
07:52:10,500 --> 07:52:18,600
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Madam Speaker, yung mga guidelines na binigay po ng Disud, it will be integrated po sa mga CLUP nila.

7089
07:52:19,500 --> 07:52:21,040
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: And na-integrate po ba?

7090
07:52:22,400 --> 07:52:24,840
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Ongoing naman po, Madam Speaker.

7091
07:52:24,880 --> 07:52:27,880
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Pwede na lang po mabigyan kami ng development.

7092
07:52:28,460 --> 07:52:29,760
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Yes, we can provide you po.

7093
07:52:29,820 --> 07:52:38,760
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: At least po, kailangan may report tayo kung anong, how we are going to it through these guidelines, paano yung compliance ng mga local government.

7094
07:52:39,700 --> 07:52:41,280
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Yes, we will provide you, Madam Speaker.

7095
07:52:41,280 --> 07:52:49,540
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Especially, kasi we cannot just, ano yun, yung MMDA po, it's toothless. They have so much responsibility but they have no authority.

7096
07:52:49,540 --> 07:52:54,040
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: They have no mandate from the people.

7097
07:52:54,040 --> 07:52:59,860
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Unlike yung 17 independent local governments.

7098
07:53:00,740 --> 07:53:08,320
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Anyway, may napansin din po ako, yung deteriorating NHA estates and vertical housing.

7099
07:53:09,780 --> 07:53:22,800
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Kung wala po bang maintenance program ang NHA pagdating po sa, nag-deteriorate na po yung mga housing projects natin.

7100
07:53:22,800 --> 07:53:23,820
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Especially, it's toothless.

7101
07:53:23,820 --> 07:53:35,560
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Actually, in Metro Manila, lumiliit yung mga eskinita, pati po mga sidewalk, malalagyan na rin ng mga extension.

7102
07:53:37,120 --> 07:53:47,180
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Yung ating, although nagpapasalamat tayo sa DSUD, dahil magkaroon tayo ng pilot project sa aking distrito para po dun sa mga spaghetti wires.

7103
07:53:47,180 --> 07:53:52,240
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Pero meron po ba tayong pangkahalatang plano?

7104
07:53:52,940 --> 07:53:53,660
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Para sa mga...

7105
07:53:53,820 --> 07:53:58,040
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: NHA housing projects para po ma-maintain naman.

7106
07:53:58,680 --> 07:54:05,720
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Kasi po, nagiging nangyayari, yung NHA project, nagiging depressed area na po.

7107
07:54:07,180 --> 07:54:10,320
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Parang from slums to slums.

7108
07:54:10,320 --> 07:54:22,320
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Ganun lang nangyayari kung hindi natin ma-maintain, ma-improve yung ating mga NHA housing projects at...

7109
07:54:23,820 --> 07:54:32,340
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Yung kinakailangan ba ng dagdag na pondo ng NHA from the GAA para magampanan natin ito?

7110
07:54:32,460 --> 07:54:41,900
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: O sapat na ba yung mga kasalukuyang collections ng NHA para ma-improve itong mga national housing projects na ito?

7111
07:54:44,640 --> 07:54:46,900
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Madam Speaker, as for the...

7112
07:54:47,840 --> 07:54:53,160
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Yung na-turnover na po, hindi na po under NHA.

7113
07:54:53,160 --> 07:55:03,740
