Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Hindi, ano po yung gagawa ng paraan?

7116
07:55:09,320 --> 07:55:17,700
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Meron pa pong policy na, policy direction para ma-maintain itong mga medium rise.

7117
07:55:18,520 --> 07:55:19,160
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Madam Speaker...

7118
