Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Meron po bang ano to?

7119
07:55:20,640 --> 07:55:23,020
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: For example, may annual budget pa.

7120
07:55:23,160 --> 07:55:25,600
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: For maintenance ng mga medium rise.

7121
07:55:27,200 --> 07:55:32,980
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Madam Speaker, for those turned over na po ng mga units, wala na po si LGU.

7122
