Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: It's with the whole one or LGU po, Madam Speaker.

7123
07:55:36,860 --> 07:55:41,540
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: But for those condemned, yun po ang gagawa ng paraan ni NHA.

7124
07:55:41,540 --> 07:55:48,940
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Kung na-turnover na po sa local government, yung mga projects na hindi naman po medium rise,

7125
07:55:48,940 --> 07:55:50,940
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: yung regular...

7126
