7128
07:56:06,000 --> 07:56:10,780
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: At naka-define po ba doon yung mga responsibilities ng local government?

7129
07:56:12,240 --> 07:56:15,580
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Madam Speaker, as for the local government, may deed of the nation na po.

7130
07:56:15,700 --> 07:56:18,720
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: So once the turnover, it's for the local government po.

7131
07:56:19,880 --> 07:56:21,000
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Should make sure to maintain...

7132
07:56:21,000 --> 07:56:21,180
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Pero maliwa...

7133
07:56:21,180 --> 07:56:22,200
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Sa deed of the...

7134
07:56:22,200 --> 07:56:23,000
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Sa...

7135
07:56:23,160 --> 07:56:29,640
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Turnover po, deed of turnover, meron po bang specific na mga provisions doon na may...

7136
07:56:29,640 --> 07:56:31,140
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Absolute po yan, Mr. Speaker, Madam Speaker.

7137
07:56:31,140 --> 07:56:33,780
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Kung ano yung responsibilidad na ng local government?

7138
07:56:34,280 --> 07:56:36,460
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Wala na po. It's absolute po yan, Madam Speaker.

7139
07:56:37,060 --> 07:56:37,600
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Wala na po.

7140
07:56:37,660 --> 07:56:38,380
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Yes, po.

7141
07:56:38,980 --> 07:56:41,540
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: So it's no longer an NHA project?

7142
07:56:42,680 --> 07:56:43,140
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Yes, po.

7143
07:56:43,780 --> 07:56:44,380
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Salamat po.

7144
