Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: 16.

7165
07:58:49,240 --> 07:58:51,660
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Except Manila and Taguig.

7166
07:58:51,660 --> 07:58:53,140
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: 18 na yan, 17?

7167
