Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Ay, anong Pateros? Meron.

7178
07:59:15,160 --> 07:59:19,160
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Meron. Pero hindi municipality si Pateros kasi hindi siya…

7179
07:59:19,160 --> 07:59:23,160
