7180
07:59:23,160 --> 07:59:29,160
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Kasi Metro Manila is composed of 16 cities and 1 municipality. Tama.

7181
07:59:29,160 --> 07:59:34,160
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: So, 15, may dalawa na wala pa.

7182
07:59:34,160 --> 07:59:38,160
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Ano pong nagiging problema? Bakit wala pa?

7183
07:59:40,160 --> 07:59:43,160
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: They are still updating their CLUP, Madam Speaker.

7184
