Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Pardon?

7185
07:59:50,160 --> 07:59:51,160
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: They are still updating.

7186
07:59:51,160 --> 07:59:54,160
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: May mga deadlines po ba yan?

7187
07:59:57,160 --> 07:59:59,460
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Walang deadline but the earlier the better.

7188
07:59:59,460 --> 08:00:05,300
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Madam Speaker, but they send them reminders naman. These hoods are giving them their reminders naman, Madam Speaker.

7189
08:00:07,380 --> 08:00:15,080
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Ang ibig pong sabihin nun, kung wala pong zoning and land use,

7190
